OL,3,AAsos app users tell BBC they are
OL,4,A'scared' after 'concerning' pop-up
OL,5,Amessage apparently from hackers
OL,6,
OL,7,FAsos app users have seen a pop-up
OL,8,Fmessage apparently sent by hackers -
OL,9,Fhere's what we know so far
OL,11,F"Dear Asos DPO and IT, we have fully
OL,12,Fcompromised the Snowflake instance.
OL,13,FEngage with us, or we will leak it,"
OL,14,Fthe message reads
OL,16,FOne customer, from Canterbury, says
OL,17,Fthey are "scared to go into the app".
OL,18,FAnother - Jodie from Edinburgh - says
OL,19,F"it's concerning" and that she
OL,20,Finitially thought the notification was
OL,21,F"an ad or fun promotion"
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
