OL,3,AAsos app users tell BBC they are
OL,4,A'scared' after 'concerning' pop-up
OL,5,Amessage apparently from hackers
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Snowflake" refers to a data storage
OL,8,Fcompany, whose popular tools have been
OL,9,Fused by dozens of firms for collecting,
OL,10,Fanalysing and storing data
OL,12,FOur reporter asks Asos' chatbot whether
OL,13,Fher account is compromised - the bot
OL,14,Fsays "we're aware of the notification"
OL,15,Fand "investigating"
OL,17,FMeanwhile, shares in the online
OL,18,Fretailer are down, with Asos yet to
OL,19,Fcomment on the incident
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
